High-Impact Portfolio Projects to Get Hired

To catch an employer's eye or back up a research application, build projects that showcase both OpenCV and AI working together:
1. The Smart Traffic / Logistics Monitor: Use OpenCV background subtraction to spot motion. When motion passes a virtual line, trigger a YOLO model to classify the vehicle/package. Use geometric calculations in OpenCV to estimate its speed or dimensions.
2. Automated Defect Detection System: Simulate an industrial conveyor belt. Use OpenCV color masking and contour detection to isolate a product, measure its precise pixel area to check for physical deformities, and log the metadata.
3. Real-time Edge Anonymizer: Build a privacy tool that streams a camera feed, detects faces/license plates using a lightweight neural network via the OpenCV dnn module, and applies an OpenCV Gaussian blur to those exact bounding boxes with minimum latency.
